  "full_response": "Certainly! Below is a JSON Schema definition for a user registration form with the specified fields: `username`, `email`, `password`, `date_of_birth`, and an `address` object.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"title\": \"User Registration Form\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"username\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"minLength\": 3,\n      \"maxLength\": 30,\n      \"pattern\": \"^[a-zA-Z0-9_]+$\",\n      \"description\": \"A unique username consisting of alphanumeric characters and underscores.\"\n    },\n    \"email\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"format\": \"email\",\n      \"description\": \"A valid email address.\"\n    },\n    \"password\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"minLength\": 8,\n      \"description\": \"A password with a minimum length of 8 characters.\"\n    },\n    \"date_of_birth\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"format\": \"date\",\n      \"description\": \"The user's date of birth.\"\n    },\n    \"address\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"street\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"Street address.\"\n        },\n        \"city\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"City name.\"\n        },\n        \"state\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"maxLength\": 2,\n          \"description\": \"State or province code.\"\n        },\n        \"postal_code\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"Postal or ZIP code.\"\n        },\n        \"country\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"Country name.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\"street\", \"city\", \"postal_code\", \"country\"],\n      \"description\": \"User's mailing address.\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"username\", \"email\", \"password\", \"date_of_birth\", \"address\"],\n  \"description\": \"Schema for a user registration form.\"\n}\n```\n\n### Key Points:\n- **username**: Must be alphanumeric with underscores, between 3 and 30 characters.\n- **email**: Must be a valid email format.\n- **password**: Minimum of 8 characters.\n- **date_of_birth**: Must be a valid date.\n- **address",
